--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/counter.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+Feature: Todo count and clear-completed
+  As a user
+  I want to see how many active todos remain and clear completed ones
+  So that I can track progress and clean up
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And localStorage is empty
+
+  Rule: Active count
+
+  Scenario: Shows singular "item" for one active todo
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Shows plural "items" for multiple active todos
+    Given 2 active todos exist
+    Then the todo-count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Count wraps count in <strong>
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    Then the todo-count number is wrapped in a <strong> tag
+
+  Scenario: Count decreases when a todo is completed
+    Given 2 active todos exist
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for the first todo
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Count shows zero when all todos are completed
+    Given 2 active todos exist
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then the todo-count shows "0 items left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given 2 active todos exist
+    Then the clear-completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed button appears when a todo is completed
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    When I toggle "Buy milk" as completed
+    Then the clear-completed button is visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given 2 active todos and 1 completed todo exist
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list contains only the 2 active todos
+    And the clear-completed button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Toggling all then clearing shows footer as hidden
+    Given 3 todos exist
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    And I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the "#main" section is not visible
+    And the "#footer" section is not visible
