diff --git a/features/editing.feature b/features/editing.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2c5689c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/editing.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
+Feature: Todo editing
+  As a user
+  I want to edit existing todo titles
+  So that I can correct or update them
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And localStorage is empty
+    And a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+
+  Rule: Entering edit mode
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a label activates editing mode
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "editing"
+    And an edit input is visible containing "Buy milk"
+    And the edit input has focus
+
+  Rule: Saving edits
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Enter saves the edit
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the edit value to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo is no longer in editing mode
+    And the todo label reads "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Scenario: Blurring the input saves the edit
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the edit value to "Buy oat milk"
+    And the edit input loses focus
+    Then the todo is no longer in editing mode
+    And the todo label reads "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Rule: Discarding edits
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Escape discards changes
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the edit value to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I press Escape in the edit input
+    Then the todo is no longer in editing mode
+    And the todo label still reads "Buy milk"
+
+  Rule: Empty edit destroys the todo
+
+  Scenario: Saving an empty title destroys the todo
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the edit value to ""
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Scenario: Saving whitespace-only title destroys the todo
+    Given I am editing the todo "Buy milk"
+    When I change the edit value to "   "
+    And I press Enter in the edit input
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
