+++ b/features/todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@
+Feature: Todo CRUD and visibility
+  As a user
+  I want to create, complete, and remove todos
+  So that I can track what needs to be done
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+    And localStorage is empty
+
+  Rule: Empty state
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    When the app renders
+    Then the "#main" section is not visible
+    And the "#footer" section is not visible
+
+  Rule: New todo creation
+
+  Scenario: Creating a todo appends it to the list and clears the input
+    Given the new-todo input has focus
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then a todo item with the title "Buy milk" appears in the todo list
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Trimming whitespace prevents empty todos
+    Given the new-todo input has focus
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then no new todo item is added to the list
+
+  Scenario: Creating multiple todos shows them in order
+    When I create a todo titled "First"
+    And I create a todo titled "Second"
+    Then the todo list contains 2 items
+    And the first todo item has title "First"
+    And the last todo item has title "Second"
+
+  Rule: Completion toggling
+
+  Scenario: Clicking a todo checkbox marks it as completed
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+    And its checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggling a completed todo back to active
+    Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" does not have class "completed"
+    And its checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Mark all as complete
+
+  Scenario: "Mark all as complete" toggles every todo
+    Given 3 active todos exist
+    When I click the "toggle-all" checkbox
+    Then every todo item has class "completed"
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all reflects per-todo state
+    Given 3 active todos exist
+    When I click the toggle checkbox for the first todo
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for the second todo
+    And I click the toggle checkbox for the third todo
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed after toggle-all unchecks toggle-all
+    Given 3 todos exist, all completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo list is empty
+    And the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+    And the "#main" section is not visible
+
+  Rule: Destroy
+
+  Scenario: Hovering reveals the destroy button
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    When I reveal the destroy button for "Buy milk"
+    Then the destroy button for "Buy milk" is visible
+
+  Scenario: Clicking destroy removes the todo
+    Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+    When I click the destroy button for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
